      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nevis%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Moser House, built in the early 1900s, once served as a fishing camp near Nevis.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
